{"page":487,"width":1875,"height":2534,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"탐색","words":[{"text":"탐색","x":427,"y":182,"width":124,"height":77}]},{"text":"13.1 탐색이란?","words":[{"text":"13.1","x":424,"y":589,"width":73,"height":50},{"text":"탐색이란?","x":520,"y":587,"width":205,"height":54}]},{"text":"사람들은 항상 무엇인가를 찾아 헤맨다. 예를 들면 출근할 때 입을 웃을 찾는다거나 서랍속의 서","words":[{"text":"사람들은","x":420,"y":733,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"항상","x":548,"y":735,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"무엇인가를","x":616,"y":735,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"찾아","x":770,"y":736,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"헤맨다.","x":837,"y":736,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":943,"y":736,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"들면","x":1009,"y":736,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"출근할","x":1078,"y":736,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"때","x":1177,"y":736,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"입을","x":1218,"y":736,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"웃을","x":1285,"y":735,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"찾는다거나","x":1357,"y":734,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"서랍속의","x":1520,"y":733,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"서","x":1652,"y":733,"width":25,"height":34}]},{"text":"류를 찾기도 한다. 컴퓨터에서도 마찬가지이다. 실제로 탐색(search)은 컴퓨터가 가장 많이 하는","words":[{"text":"류를","x":418,"y":791,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"찾기도","x":489,"y":791,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":585,"y":791,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"컴퓨터에서도","x":666,"y":791,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"마찬가지이다.","x":846,"y":793,"width":176,"height":34},{"text":"실제로","x":1038,"y":793,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"탐색(search)은","x":1134,"y":791,"width":202,"height":35},{"text":"컴퓨터가","x":1348,"y":791,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"가장","x":1479,"y":790,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1550,"y":789,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"하는","x":1621,"y":790,"width":59,"height":33}]},{"text":"작업 중의 하나이다. 간단히 여러분이 하루에 인터넷에서 필요한 자료들을 얼마나 많이 탐색하","words":[{"text":"작업","x":418,"y":846,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"중의","x":489,"y":847,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"하나이다.","x":561,"y":847,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"간단히","x":699,"y":848,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"여러분이","x":798,"y":849,"width":109,"height":34},{"text":"하루에","x":923,"y":849,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"인터넷에서","x":1022,"y":849,"width":140,"height":33},{"text":"필요한","x":1179,"y":848,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"자료들을","x":1278,"y":848,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"얼마나","x":1414,"y":848,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1517,"y":847,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"탐색하","x":1590,"y":847,"width":90,"height":33}]},{"text":"는지를 생각하면 된다. 탐색은 컴퓨터 프로그램에서 가장 많이 사\u0026하는 작업임과 동시에 많은","words":[{"text":"는지를","x":416,"y":903,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"생각하면","x":519,"y":903,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"된다.","x":646,"y":904,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"탐색은","x":726,"y":905,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":826,"y":906,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"프로그램에서","x":922,"y":905,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"가장","x":1108,"y":906,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1178,"y":905,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"사\u0026하는","x":1249,"y":905,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"작업임과","x":1382,"y":904,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"동시에","x":1515,"y":904,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":1620,"y":903,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"시간이 요구되므로 탐색을 효율적으로 수행하는 것은 매우 중요하다.","words":[{"text":"시간이","x":417,"y":958,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"요구되므로","x":515,"y":959,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"탐색을","x":669,"y":960,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"효율적으로","x":765,"y":961,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"수행하는","x":918,"y":962,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"것은","x":1044,"y":962,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"매우","x":1111,"y":962,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"중요하다.","x":1178,"y":961,"width":124,"height":33}]},{"text":"[그림 13-1] 일상생활에서의 탐색의 예","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":417,"y":1604,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"13-1]","x":485,"y":1605,"width":60,"height":30},{"text":"일상생활에서의","x":563,"y":1608,"width":156,"height":26},{"text":"탐색의","x":729,"y":1609,"width":65,"height":25},{"text":"예","x":804,"y":1609,"width":21,"height":25}]},{"text":"[그림 13-1]에서와 같이 탐색은 기본적으로 여러 개의 자료 중에서 원하는 자료를 찾는 작업이","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":451,"y":1719,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"13-1]에서와","x":523,"y":1719,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"같이","x":682,"y":1719,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"탐색은","x":749,"y":1719,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"기본적으로","x":846,"y":1719,"width":142,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":1000,"y":1719,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"개의","x":1069,"y":1718,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":1137,"y":1718,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"중에서","x":1206,"y":1718,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"원하는","x":1308,"y":1718,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"자료를","x":1408,"y":1717,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"찾는","x":1510,"y":1717,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"작업이","x":1582,"y":1718,"width":86,"height":32}]},{"text":"다. 탐색을 위하여 사용되는 자료 구조는 배열, 연결 리스트, 트리, 그래프 등 매우 다양할 수 있","words":[{"text":"다.","x":418,"y":1774,"width":35,"height":32},{"text":"탐색을","x":468,"y":1774,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"위하여","x":568,"y":1775,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"사용되는","x":663,"y":1775,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":786,"y":1775,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"구조는","x":853,"y":1776,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"배열,","x":950,"y":1775,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"연결","x":1030,"y":1774,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"리스트,","x":1099,"y":1774,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"트리,","x":1204,"y":1774,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"그래프","x":1286,"y":1774,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"등","x":1385,"y":1775,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"매우","x":1428,"y":1773,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"다양할","x":1498,"y":1773,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1600,"y":1774,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"있","x":1643,"y":1773,"width":26,"height":33}]},{"text":"다. 탐색 중에서 가장 기초적인 방법은 배열을 시용하여 자료를 저장하고 찾는 것이다. 그러나","words":[{"text":"다.","x":417,"y":1828,"width":36,"height":33},{"text":"탐색","x":471,"y":1830,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"중에서","x":542,"y":1831,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"가장","x":642,"y":1831,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"기초적인","x":712,"y":1830,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":836,"y":1830,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"배열을","x":933,"y":1830,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"시용하여","x":1032,"y":1830,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"자료를","x":1158,"y":1829,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"저장하고","x":1261,"y":1830,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"찾는","x":1393,"y":1830,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"것이다.","x":1467,"y":1829,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"그러나","x":1580,"y":1829,"width":90,"height":32}]},{"text":"탐색 성능을 향상하고자 한다면 이진 탐색 트리과 같은 보다 진보된 방법으로 자료를 저장하고","words":[{"text":"탐색","x":417,"y":1883,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"성능을","x":489,"y":1885,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"향상하고자","x":588,"y":1885,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"한다면","x":742,"y":1886,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"이진","x":840,"y":1885,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"탐색","x":907,"y":1885,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"트리과","x":976,"y":1885,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"같은","x":1074,"y":1885,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"보다","x":1143,"y":1884,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"진보된","x":1216,"y":1885,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"방법으로","x":1316,"y":1886,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"자료를","x":1447,"y":1885,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"저장하고","x":1550,"y":1885,"width":118,"height":33}]},{"text":"탐색해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"탐색해야","x":416,"y":1938,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":544,"y":1939,"width":64,"height":33}]},{"text":"탐색의 단위는 항목이다. 항목은 가장 간단하게는 숫자일 수도 있고 아니면 구조체가 될 수도","words":[{"text":"탐색의","x":449,"y":1994,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"단위는","x":548,"y":1994,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"항목이다.","x":646,"y":1995,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"항목은","x":781,"y":1995,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"가장","x":877,"y":1995,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"간단하게는","x":944,"y":1995,"width":143,"height":34},{"text":"숫자일","x":1096,"y":1995,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"수도","x":1194,"y":1996,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"있고","x":1266,"y":1996,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"아니면","x":1336,"y":1997,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"구조체가","x":1436,"y":1997,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"될","x":1566,"y":1996,"width":27,"height":32},{"text":"수도","x":1606,"y":1997,"width":59,"height":32}]},{"text":"있다. 항목 안에는 항목과 항목-을 구별시켜주는 ?l(key)가 존재한다. 이를 탐색기(search key)라","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":417,"y":2047,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"항목","x":494,"y":2048,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"안에는","x":564,"y":2048,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"항목과","x":660,"y":2050,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"항목-을","x":755,"y":2050,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"구별시켜주는","x":850,"y":2050,"width":170,"height":34},{"text":"?l(key)가","x":1031,"y":2050,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"존재한다.","x":1164,"y":2051,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"이를","x":1304,"y":2052,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"탐색기(search","x":1373,"y":2051,"width":192,"height":34},{"text":"key)라","x":1574,"y":2051,"width":91,"height":35}]},{"text":"고 한다. 탐색이란 탐색기와 데이터로 이루어진 여러 개의 항목 중에서 원하는 탐색기를 가지고","words":[{"text":"고","x":414,"y":2106,"width":29,"height":22},{"text":"한다.","x":454,"y":2102,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"탐색이란","x":536,"y":2103,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"탐색기와","x":663,"y":2104,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"데이터로","x":790,"y":2105,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"이루어진","x":915,"y":2105,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":1039,"y":2106,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"개의","x":1107,"y":2106,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"항목","x":1174,"y":2106,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"중에서","x":1243,"y":2107,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"원하는","x":1345,"y":2108,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"탐색기를","x":1445,"y":2108,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"가지고","x":1576,"y":2108,"width":88,"height":32}]},{"text":"있는 항목을 찾는 것이다.","words":[{"text":"있는","x":415,"y":2156,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"항목을","x":482,"y":2157,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"찾는","x":580,"y":2157,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"것이다.","x":650,"y":2158,"width":91,"height":34}]},{"text":"496 C언어로 쉽게 불어쓴 자료구조","words":[{"text":"496","x":139,"y":2384,"width":59,"height":28},{"text":"C언어로","x":225,"y":2386,"width":83,"height":24},{"text":"쉽게","x":316,"y":2385,"width":42,"height":24},{"text":"불어쓴","x":367,"y":2384,"width":66,"height":25},{"text":"자료구조","x":441,"y":2385,"width":88,"height":24}]}]}